# Hacedle (Refine Layer)

## Purpose

Refined inference core derived from Candle, designed for authority-aware,
resource-constrained execution in PI-Zeus.

## Scope (Phase 0)

- Tensor core extraction
- Quantized blob loading (GGUF/Safetensors)
- no_std/alloc-constrained compatibility

## Non-Goals (Phase 0)

- Full feature parity with Candle
- Dynamic shape inference across arbitrary backends
